    description: "Phase 2b of WI-zimum. WI-gipag (merged) covered the Python __all__ rule. This follow-up covers the TypeScript/JavaScript side: detect top-level export_statement nodes in js_ts.py and set Symbol.is_exported=True on the named exported declaration. Handles export default, named exports (export { foo }), and re-exports (export { foo } from './bar'). Extend the existing Next.js handler export parser in js_ts.py rather than adding a new pass. Validation: re-run WI-tubot prospector on apollo-server (85.5% baseline dead rate) and expect a meaningful drop. P4 because the Python half (WI-gipag) handled the larger dead% contributors (airflow/django/superset); TS cohort is a single repo in the current bakeoff."  # 9c5f
